+++ after/docs/quality/CI-MEASUREMENT-PLAN.md
@@ -51,3 +51,14 @@
 when required source, tools, inputs, feature scope, advisories or live settings
 change. An aggregation run is not a new performance measurement or hosted CI
 success. This local implementation has not dispatched a remote workflow.
+
+## Integration evidence without circular self-certification
+
+The integration record declares populationDigest for the complete upstream
+catalog with only that record excluded. The immutable input snapshot and its
+hash remain artifact references. A changed upstream population makes the old
+integration validation Partial even when executable source still matches.
+The emitted full catalog retains its separate full SHA-256. Each original
+criterion can have a separate outcome; pending hosted validation is not hidden
+by successful local tests. Accepted implementation and test reviews are bound
+to actual final sources, not inferred from task state or a test log.
